      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but it doesn't really change the reality of it. i see the look on his face when he's helping me walk or when he's dealing with my appointments. he looks exhausted. it's not even about me feeling better, it's about them being able to finally just... live. without having to constantly worry about me or manage my life. it feels like my existence is just a constant tax on their happiness.",
