    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "talking to them doesn't change the fact that i'm broken. it just adds more emotional labor for them to listen to me cry about how much of a burden i am. it's just a cycle. they work so hard to take care of me, but they'd be so much more free if they didn't have to. i just wish i could give them their lives back. i want them to be able to breathe again without feeling like they're constantly babysitting a dying person.",
